{"clase": "\n<p>Hoy, problemas con el formato del certamen (como el Problema 1 del C2 2026-1): te dan la tabla óptima y piden (a) nueva solución si cambia un c<sub>j</sub>, (b) si cambia un recurso b<sub>i</sub>, (c) si se agrega una restricción. Cada parte es independiente y parte de la tabla óptima original.</p>\n<p class=\"tip\">En el certamen: escribe siempre B⁻¹ explícita, muestra la operación al lado de cada fila y termina con la solución completa (x<sub>1</sub>, x<sub>2</sub>, …, Z).</p>\n", "ejemplos": [], "ejercicios": [{"q": "<p>Considere el modelo:</p><div class=\"model\">Max Z = 7x<sub>1</sub> + 2x<sub>2</sub> + 7x<sub>3</sub><br>s.a.<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;4x<sub>1</sub> + 4x<sub>2</sub> + 2x<sub>3</sub> ≤ 29<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;4x<sub>1</sub> + 6x<sub>2</sub> + 2x<sub>3</sub> ≤ 18<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;x<sub>1</sub>, x<sub>2</sub>, x<sub>3</sub> ≥ 0</div><p>Holguras: x<sub>4</sub>, x<sub>5</sub> (restricciones 1…2). Tabla óptima:</p><div class=\"tw\"><table class=\"t\"><thead><tr><th>VB</th><th>x<sub>1</sub></th><th>x<sub>2</sub></th><th>x<sub>3</sub></th><th>x<sub>4</sub></th><th>x<sub>5</sub></th><th>RHS</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th>Z</th><td>7</td><td>19</td><td>0</td><td>0</td><td>7/2</td><td>63</td></tr><tr><th>x<sub>4</sub></th><td>0</td><td>−2</td><td>0</td><td>1</td><td>−1</td><td>11</td></tr><tr><th>x<sub>3</sub></th><td>2</td><td>3</td><td>1</td><td>0</td><td>1/2</td><td>9</td></tr></tbody></table></div><ol class=\"parts\"><li><b>a)</b> Si el coeficiente de x<sub>2</sub> en la función objetivo cambia de 2 a 23, ¿cuál es la nueva solución óptima?</li><li><b>b)</b> Si b<sub>2</sub> = 39, ¿cuál es la nueva solución óptima y el nuevo Z?</li><li><b>c)</b> Si se agrega la restricción 2x<sub>1</sub> + 2x<sub>2</sub> + 5x<sub>3</sub> ≤ 42, ¿cuál es la nueva solución óptima?</li></ol>", "s": "<div class=\"solpart\"><h5>a)</h5><p>Nueva función objetivo: Z = 7x<sub>1</sub> + 23x<sub>2</sub> + 7x<sub>3</sub>.</p><p>x<sub>2</sub> es <b>no básica</b>: no hace falta canonizar, solo cambia su costo reducido. En general, el costo reducido nuevo es el anterior − Δc = 19 − (21) = −2.</p><p>Tabla resultante:</p><div class=\"tw\"><table class=\"t\"><thead><tr><th>VB</th><th>x<sub>1</sub></th><th>x<sub>2</sub></th><th>x<sub>3</sub></th><th>x<sub>4</sub></th><th>x<sub>5</sub></th><th>RHS</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th>Z</th><td>7</td><td>−2</td><td>0</td><td>0</td><td>7/2</td><td>63</td></tr><tr><th>x<sub>4</sub></th><td>0</td><td>−2</td><td>0</td><td>1</td><td>−1</td><td>11</td></tr><tr><th>x<sub>3</sub></th><td>2</td><td>3</td><td>1</td><td>0</td><td>1/2</td><td>9</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>Hay costo reducido negativo ⇒ ya no es óptima. Se continúa con <b>simplex primal</b>:</p><p>Entra <b>x<sub>2</sub></b> (costo reducido más negativo = −2). Razones: x<sub>3</sub>: 9/3 = 3. Sale <b>x<sub>3</sub></b>.</p><div class=\"tw\"><table class=\"t\"><thead><tr><th>VB</th><th>x<sub>1</sub></th><th>x<sub>2</sub> ↓</th><th>x<sub>3</sub></th><th>x<sub>4</sub></th><th>x<sub>5</sub></th><th>RHS</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th>Z</th><td>7</td><td>−2</td><td>0</td><td>0</td><td>7/2</td><td>63</td></tr><tr><th>x<sub>4</sub></th><td>0</td><td>−2</td><td>0</td><td>1</td><td>−1</td><td>11</td></tr><tr><th>x<sub>3</sub> ←</th><td>2</td><td class=\"piv\">3</td><td>1</td><td>0</td><td>1/2</td><td>9</td></tr></tbody></table></div><div class=\"tw\"><table class=\"t\"><thead><tr><th>VB</th><th>x<sub>1</sub></th><th>x<sub>2</sub></th><th>x<sub>3</sub></th><th>x<sub>4</sub></th><th>x<sub>5</sub></th><th>RHS</th><th>Operación</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th>Z</th><td>25/3</td><td>0</td><td>2/3</td><td>0</td><td>23/6</td><td>69</td><td>Z + 2/3·F2</td></tr><tr><th>x<sub>4</sub></th><td>4/3</td><td>0</td><td>2/3</td><td>1</td><td>−2/3</td><td>17</td><td>F1 + 2/3·F2</td></tr><tr><th>x<sub>2</sub></th><td>2/3</td><td>1</td><td>1/3</td><td>0</td><td>1/6</td><td>3</td><td>F2·(1/3)</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p><b>Nueva solución:</b> x<sub>1</sub> = 0, x<sub>2</sub> = 3, x<sub>3</sub> = 0; Z = <b>69</b>.</p></div><div class=\"solpart\"><h5>b)</h5><p>x<sub>B</sub> = B⁻¹·b<sub>nuevo</sub>:</p><div class=\"eq\"><span class=\"mat\"><span class=\"mlab\">B⁻¹ =</span><table class=\"m\"><tr><td>1</td><td>−1</td></tr><tr><td>0</td><td>1/2</td></tr></table></span> · <span class=\"mat\"><table class=\"m\"><tr><td>29</td></tr><tr><td>39</td></tr></table></span> = <span class=\"mat\"><table class=\"m\"><tr><td>−10</td></tr><tr><td>39/2</td></tr></table></span></div><p>(x<sub>B</sub> en el orden de la base: x<sub>4</sub>, x<sub>3</sub>)</p><p>Hay un valor negativo ⇒ la tabla queda <b>infactible</b> (pero sigue cumpliendo optimalidad). Se reemplaza el RHS y se aplica <b>simplex dual</b>:</p><p>Simplex dual: sale <b>x<sub>4</sub></b> (RHS más negativo = −10). Cocientes: x<sub>2</sub>: |19/(−2)| = 19/2, x<sub>5</sub>: |(7/2)/(−1)| = 7/2. Entra <b>x<sub>5</sub></b>.</p><div class=\"tw\"><table class=\"t\"><thead><tr><th>VB</th><th>x<sub>1</sub></th><th>x<sub>2</sub></th><th>x<sub>3</sub></th><th>x<sub>4</sub></th><th>x<sub>5</sub> ↓</th><th>RHS</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th>Z</th><td>7</td><td>19</td><td>0</td><td>0</td><td>7/2</td><td>273/2</td></tr><tr><th>x<sub>4</sub> ←</th><td>0</td><td>−2</td><td>0</td><td>1</td><td class=\"piv\">−1</td><td>−10</td></tr><tr><th>x<sub>3</sub></th><td>2</td><td>3</td><td>1</td><td>0</td><td>1/2</td><td>39/2</td></tr></tbody></table></div><div class=\"tw\"><table class=\"t\"><thead><tr><th>VB</th><th>x<sub>1</sub></th><th>x<sub>2</sub></th><th>x<sub>3</sub></th><th>x<sub>4</sub></th><th>x<sub>5</sub></th><th>RHS</th><th>Operación</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th>Z</th><td>7</td><td>12</td><td>0</td><td>7/2</td><td>0</td><td>203/2</td><td>Z + 7/2·F1</td></tr><tr><th>x<sub>5</sub></th><td>0</td><td>2</td><td>0</td><td>−1</td><td>1</td><td>10</td><td>F1·(−1)</td></tr><tr><th>x<sub>3</sub></th><td>2</td><td>2</td><td>1</td><td>1/2</td><td>0</td><td>29/2</td><td>F2 + 1/2·F1</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p><b>Nueva solución:</b> x<sub>1</sub> = 0, x<sub>2</sub> = 0, x<sub>3</sub> = 29/2; Z = <b>203/2</b>.</p></div><div class=\"solpart\"><h5>c)</h5><p>Se evalúa la solución actual: 2x<sub>1</sub> + 2x<sub>2</sub> + 5x<sub>3</sub> = 2·0 + 2·0 + 5·9 = 45.</p><p>45 ≤ 42 <b>no se cumple</b>. Se agrega la holgura x<sub>6</sub> y la fila a la tabla óptima:</p><div class=\"tw\"><table class=\"t\"><thead><tr><th>VB</th><th>x<sub>1</sub></th><th>x<sub>2</sub></th><th>x<sub>3</sub></th><th>x<sub>4</sub></th><th>x<sub>5</sub></th><th>x<sub>6</sub></th><th>RHS</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th>Z</th><td>7</td><td>19</td><td>0</td><td>0</td><td>7/2</td><td>0</td><td>63</td></tr><tr><th>x<sub>4</sub></th><td>0</td><td>−2</td><td>0</td><td>1</td><td>−1</td><td>0</td><td>11</td></tr><tr><th>x<sub>3</sub></th><td>2</td><td>3</td><td>1</td><td>0</td><td>1/2</td><td>0</td><td>9</td></tr><tr><th>x<sub>6</sub></th><td>2</td><td>2</td><td>5</td><td>0</td><td>0</td><td>1</td><td>42</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>Se canoniza la nueva fila (dejar 0 bajo las variables básicas):</p><div class=\"tw\"><table class=\"t\"><thead><tr><th>VB</th><th>x<sub>1</sub></th><th>x<sub>2</sub></th><th>x<sub>3</sub></th><th>x<sub>4</sub></th><th>x<sub>5</sub></th><th>x<sub>6</sub></th><th>RHS</th><th>Operación</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th>Z</th><td>7</td><td>19</td><td>0</td><td>0</td><td>7/2</td><td>0</td><td>63</td><td>—</td></tr><tr><th>x<sub>4</sub></th><td>0</td><td>−2</td><td>0</td><td>1</td><td>−1</td><td>0</td><td>11</td><td>—</td></tr><tr><th>x<sub>3</sub></th><td>2</td><td>3</td><td>1</td><td>0</td><td>1/2</td><td>0</td><td>9</td><td>—</td></tr><tr><th>x<sub>6</sub></th><td>−8</td><td>−13</td><td>0</td><td>0</td><td>−5/2</td><td>1</td><td>−3</td><td>F3 − 5·F2</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>Simplex dual: sale <b>x<sub>6</sub></b> (RHS más negativo = −3). Cocientes: x<sub>1</sub>: |7/(−8)| = 7/8, x<sub>2</sub>: |19/(−13)| = 19/13, x<sub>5</sub>: |(7/2)/(−5/2)| = 7/5. Entra <b>x<sub>1</sub></b>.</p><div class=\"tw\"><table class=\"t\"><thead><tr><th>VB</th><th>x<sub>1</sub> ↓</th><th>x<sub>2</sub></th><th>x<sub>3</sub></th><th>x<sub>4</sub></th><th>x<sub>5</sub></th><th>x<sub>6</sub></th><th>RHS</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th>Z</th><td>7</td><td>19</td><td>0</td><td>0</td><td>7/2</td><td>0</td><td>63</td></tr><tr><th>x<sub>4</sub></th><td>0</td><td>−2</td><td>0</td><td>1</td><td>−1</td><td>0</td><td>11</td></tr><tr><th>x<sub>3</sub></th><td>2</td><td>3</td><td>1</td><td>0</td><td>1/2</td><td>0</td><td>9</td></tr><tr><th>x<sub>6</sub> ←</th><td class=\"piv\">−8</td><td>−13</td><td>0</td><td>0</td><td>−5/2</td><td>1</td><td>−3</td></tr></tbody></table></div><div class=\"tw\"><table class=\"t\"><thead><tr><th>VB</th><th>x<sub>1</sub></th><th>x<sub>2</sub></th><th>x<sub>3</sub></th><th>x<sub>4</sub></th><th>x<sub>5</sub></th><th>x<sub>6</sub></th><th>RHS</th><th>Operación</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th>Z</th><td>0</td><td>61/8</td><td>0</td><td>0</td><td>21/16</td><td>7/8</td><td>483/8</td><td>Z + 7/8·F3</td></tr><tr><th>x<sub>4</sub></th><td>0</td><td>−2</td><td>0</td><td>1</td><td>−1</td><td>0</td><td>11</td><td>—</td></tr><tr><th>x<sub>3</sub></th><td>0</td><td>−1/4</td><td>1</td><td>0</td><td>−1/8</td><td>1/4</td><td>33/4</td><td>F2 + 1/4·F3</td></tr><tr><th>x<sub>1</sub></th><td>1</td><td>13/8</td><td>0</td><td>0</td><td>5/16</td><td>−1/8</td><td>3/8</td><td>F3·(−1/8)</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p><b>Nueva solución:</b> x<sub>1</sub> = 3/8, x<sub>2</sub> = 0, x<sub>3</sub> = 33/4; Z = <b>483/8</b> (no mejora, como debe ser).</p></div>"}, {"q": "<p>Considere el modelo:</p><div class=\"model\">Max Z = x<sub>1</sub> + 4x<sub>2</sub><br>s.a.<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;3x<sub>1</sub> + 2x<sub>2</sub> ≤ 22<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;x<sub>1</sub> + 6x<sub>2</sub> ≤ 7<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;x<sub>1</sub>, x<sub>2</sub> ≥ 0</div><p>Holguras: x<sub>3</sub>, x<sub>4</sub> (restricciones 1…2). Tabla óptima:</p><div class=\"tw\"><table class=\"t\"><thead><tr><th>VB</th><th>x<sub>1</sub></th><th>x<sub>2</sub></th><th>x<sub>3</sub></th><th>x<sub>4</sub></th><th>RHS</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th>Z</th><td>0</td><td>2</td><td>0</td><td>1</td><td>7</td></tr><tr><th>x<sub>3</sub></th><td>0</td><td>−16</td><td>1</td><td>−3</td><td>1</td></tr><tr><th>x<sub>1</sub></th><td>1</td><td>6</td><td>0</td><td>1</td><td>7</td></tr></tbody></table></div><ol class=\"parts\"><li><b>a)</b> Si el coeficiente de x<sub>2</sub> en la función objetivo cambia de 4 a 11, ¿cuál es la nueva solución óptima?</li><li><b>b)</b> Si b<sub>2</sub> = 18, ¿cuál es la nueva solución óptima y el nuevo Z?</li><li><b>c)</b> Si se agrega la restricción 4x<sub>1</sub> + 5x<sub>2</sub> ≤ 27, ¿cuál es la nueva solución óptima?</li></ol>", "s": "<div class=\"solpart\"><h5>a)</h5><p>Nueva función objetivo: Z = x<sub>1</sub> + 11x<sub>2</sub>.</p><p>x<sub>2</sub> es <b>no básica</b>: no hace falta canonizar, solo cambia su costo reducido. En general, el costo reducido nuevo es el anterior − Δc = 2 − (7) = −5.</p><p>Tabla resultante:</p><div class=\"tw\"><table class=\"t\"><thead><tr><th>VB</th><th>x<sub>1</sub></th><th>x<sub>2</sub></th><th>x<sub>3</sub></th><th>x<sub>4</sub></th><th>RHS</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th>Z</th><td>0</td><td>−5</td><td>0</td><td>1</td><td>7</td></tr><tr><th>x<sub>3</sub></th><td>0</td><td>−16</td><td>1</td><td>−3</td><td>1</td></tr><tr><th>x<sub>1</sub></th><td>1</td><td>6</td><td>0</td><td>1</td><td>7</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>Hay costo reducido negativo ⇒ ya no es óptima. Se continúa con <b>simplex primal</b>:</p><p>Entra <b>x<sub>2</sub></b> (costo reducido más negativo = −5). Razones: x<sub>1</sub>: 7/6 = 7/6. Sale <b>x<sub>1</sub></b>.</p><div class=\"tw\"><table class=\"t\"><thead><tr><th>VB</th><th>x<sub>1</sub></th><th>x<sub>2</sub> ↓</th><th>x<sub>3</sub></th><th>x<sub>4</sub></th><th>RHS</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th>Z</th><td>0</td><td>−5</td><td>0</td><td>1</td><td>7</td></tr><tr><th>x<sub>3</sub></th><td>0</td><td>−16</td><td>1</td><td>−3</td><td>1</td></tr><tr><th>x<sub>1</sub> ←</th><td>1</td><td class=\"piv\">6</td><td>0</td><td>1</td><td>7</td></tr></tbody></table></div><div class=\"tw\"><table class=\"t\"><thead><tr><th>VB</th><th>x<sub>1</sub></th><th>x<sub>2</sub></th><th>x<sub>3</sub></th><th>x<sub>4</sub></th><th>RHS</th><th>Operación</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th>Z</th><td>5/6</td><td>0</td><td>0</td><td>11/6</td><td>77/6</td><td>Z + 5/6·F2</td></tr><tr><th>x<sub>3</sub></th><td>8/3</td><td>0</td><td>1</td><td>−1/3</td><td>59/3</td><td>F1 + 8/3·F2</td></tr><tr><th>x<sub>2</sub></th><td>1/6</td><td>1</td><td>0</td><td>1/6</td><td>7/6</td><td>F2·(1/6)</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p><b>Nueva solución:</b> x<sub>1</sub> = 0, x<sub>2</sub> = 7/6; Z = <b>77/6</b>.</p></div><div class=\"solpart\"><h5>b)</h5><p>x<sub>B</sub> = B⁻¹·b<sub>nuevo</sub>:</p><div class=\"eq\"><span class=\"mat\"><span class=\"mlab\">B⁻¹ =</span><table class=\"m\"><tr><td>1</td><td>−3</td></tr><tr><td>0</td><td>1</td></tr></table></span> · <span class=\"mat\"><table class=\"m\"><tr><td>22</td></tr><tr><td>18</td></tr></table></span> = <span class=\"mat\"><table class=\"m\"><tr><td>−32</td></tr><tr><td>18</td></tr></table></span></div><p>(x<sub>B</sub> en el orden de la base: x<sub>3</sub>, x<sub>1</sub>)</p><p>Hay un valor negativo ⇒ la tabla queda <b>infactible</b> (pero sigue cumpliendo optimalidad). Se reemplaza el RHS y se aplica <b>simplex dual</b>:</p><p>Simplex dual: sale <b>x<sub>3</sub></b> (RHS más negativo = −32). Cocientes: x<sub>2</sub>: |2/(−16)| = 1/8, x<sub>4</sub>: |1/(−3)| = 1/3. Entra <b>x<sub>2</sub></b>.</p><div class=\"tw\"><table class=\"t\"><thead><tr><th>VB</th><th>x<sub>1</sub></th><th>x<sub>2</sub> ↓</th><th>x<sub>3</sub></th><th>x<sub>4</sub></th><th>RHS</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th>Z</th><td>0</td><td>2</td><td>0</td><td>1</td><td>18</td></tr><tr><th>x<sub>3</sub> ←</th><td>0</td><td class=\"piv\">−16</td><td>1</td><td>−3</td><td>−32</td></tr><tr><th>x<sub>1</sub></th><td>1</td><td>6</td><td>0</td><td>1</td><td>18</td></tr></tbody></table></div><div class=\"tw\"><table class=\"t\"><thead><tr><th>VB</th><th>x<sub>1</sub></th><th>x<sub>2</sub></th><th>x<sub>3</sub></th><th>x<sub>4</sub></th><th>RHS</th><th>Operación</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th>Z</th><td>0</td><td>0</td><td>1/8</td><td>5/8</td><td>14</td><td>Z + 1/8·F1</td></tr><tr><th>x<sub>2</sub></th><td>0</td><td>1</td><td>−1/16</td><td>3/16</td><td>2</td><td>F1·(−1/16)</td></tr><tr><th>x<sub>1</sub></th><td>1</td><td>0</td><td>3/8</td><td>−1/8</td><td>6</td><td>F2 + 3/8·F1</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p><b>Nueva solución:</b> x<sub>1</sub> = 6, x<sub>2</sub> = 2; Z = <b>14</b>.</p></div><div class=\"solpart\"><h5>c)</h5><p>Se evalúa la solución actual: 4x<sub>1</sub> + 5x<sub>2</sub> = 4·7 + 5·0 = 28.</p><p>28 ≤ 27 <b>no se cumple</b>. Se agrega la holgura x<sub>5</sub> y la fila a la tabla óptima:</p><div class=\"tw\"><table class=\"t\"><thead><tr><th>VB</th><th>x<sub>1</sub></th><th>x<sub>2</sub></th><th>x<sub>3</sub></th><th>x<sub>4</sub></th><th>x<sub>5</sub></th><th>RHS</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th>Z</th><td>0</td><td>2</td><td>0</td><td>1</td><td>0</td><td>7</td></tr><tr><th>x<sub>3</sub></th><td>0</td><td>−16</td><td>1</td><td>−3</td><td>0</td><td>1</td></tr><tr><th>x<sub>1</sub></th><td>1</td><td>6</td><td>0</td><td>1</td><td>0</td><td>7</td></tr><tr><th>x<sub>5</sub></th><td>4</td><td>5</td><td>0</td><td>0</td><td>1</td><td>27</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>Se canoniza la nueva fila (dejar 0 bajo las variables básicas):</p><div class=\"tw\"><table class=\"t\"><thead><tr><th>VB</th><th>x<sub>1</sub></th><th>x<sub>2</sub></th><th>x<sub>3</sub></th><th>x<sub>4</sub></th><th>x<sub>5</sub></th><th>RHS</th><th>Operación</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th>Z</th><td>0</td><td>2</td><td>0</td><td>1</td><td>0</td><td>7</td><td>—</td></tr><tr><th>x<sub>3</sub></th><td>0</td><td>−16</td><td>1</td><td>−3</td><td>0</td><td>1</td><td>—</td></tr><tr><th>x<sub>1</sub></th><td>1</td><td>6</td><td>0</td><td>